At a press conference[, university police] chief Dale Brophy said that McCluskey had filed a police report[ with] them “on Oct. 12 and Oct. 13” about threats from Row[land].[ There] was “some follow-up” and[ it] was assigned[ to a detective] who was “working to build a case against our suspect at that time,” Brophy[ said].[ The police] chief would not go into further details about what happened with that investigation.
